# lock debris moved aside on the durable machine, whose VM cannot unlink.
# It is working-tree litter, never repository content: 11.4 MB of it reached
# `master` in two commits on 2026-09-21 and is still there. Ignoring it here so
# a future session cannot repeat that on this branch.
_to_delete/

